  <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="beams" width="1440" height="1000" viewBox="0 0 1440 1000"><polygon class="v" points="619.2 253.4 684 252 684 279 619.2 345.4 613.2 345.4 613.2 253.4"/><polygon class="a" points="586.8 363.8 1032 413 1032 439 586.8 455.8 580.8 455.8 580.8 363.8"/><polygon class="g" points="835.1 474.2 1032 660 1032 699 835.1 566.2 829.1 566.2 829.1 474.2"/></svg>

    <article class="sheet plan main" style="--x:684px;--y:72px;--w:324px;--mw:342px">
      <h2>The plan</h2>
      <p class="pr">Claude Code wrote it in the team’s space. The team read it and marked one step.</p>
      <div class="fig"><svg class="dw" viewBox="0 0 324 116"><rect class="bar" x="22" y="6" width="96" height="5" rx="2.500"/><rect class="bar" x="22" y="20" width="270" height="4" rx="2"/><rect class="bar" x="22" y="30" width="226" height="4" rx="2"/><rect class="box" x="22.5" y="46.5" width="56" height="18" rx="2"/><rect class="bar" x="35.5" y="53.500" width="30" height="4" rx="2"/><rect class="box" x="104.5" y="46.5" width="56" height="18" rx="2"/><rect class="bar" x="117.5" y="53.500" width="30" height="4" rx="2"/><rect class="box" x="186.5" y="46.5" width="56" height="18" rx="2"/><rect class="bar" x="199.5" y="53.500" width="30" height="4" rx="2"/><path class="l" d="M78.5 55.500H104.500M160.500 55.500H186.500"/><rect class="hit v" x="0" y="74" width="324" height="27"/><text class="kt b" x="22" y="92">On a clash, keep both</text><text class="pc-s e" x="302" y="92">Ramos</text><rect class="bar" x="22" y="110" width="250" height="4" rx="2"/></svg></div>
      <p class="q">Both are kept. <b>Claude Code</b> changed this step on the team’s call.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="sheet call main" style="--x:1032px;--y:255px;--w:312px;--mw:342px">
      <h2>Which decision?</h2>
      <svg class="dw" viewBox="0 0 312 170"><rect class="bx" x="22.5" y=".500" width="126" height="92" rx="3"/><path class="l" d="M22.5 15.500H148.5"/><rect class="f" x="31.5" y="5" width="6" height="7" rx="1"/><rect class="bar" x="43.5" y="6.500" width="34" height="4" rx="2"/><text class="b" x="32.5" y="34.500">Site visit</text><text class="w" x="32.5" y="55">Meter reads 4407</text><text class="w" x="32.5" y="74">Meter reads 4410</text><rect class="bx" x="163.5" y=".500" width="126" height="92" rx="3"/><path class="l" d="M163.5 15.500H289.5"/><rect class="f" x="172.5" y="5" width="6" height="7" rx="1"/><rect class="bar" x="184.5" y="6.500" width="34" height="4" rx="2"/><text class="b" x="173.5" y="34.500">Site visit</text><text class="w" x="173.5" y="55">Meter reads 4410</text><rect class="hit a" x="0" y="102" width="149" height="26"/><text class="kt b" x="22" y="119.600">Keep both</text><text class="b" x="163" y="119.600">Newest wins</text><text class="s n" x="22" y="146">Both readings stay.</text><text class="s n" x="22" y="164">A day more to build.</text><text class="s n" x="163" y="146">One reading is lost.</text><text class="s n" x="163" y="164">Nothing to build.</text></svg>
      <p class="hand">never lose a decision. Ramos</p>
    </article>
    <article class="sheet mock main" style="--x:1032px;--y:558px;--w:312px;--mw:342px">
      <h2>Built as planned</h2>
      <div class="fig"><svg class="dw" viewBox="0 0 312 40"><path class="l" d="M78.5 20H104.5M160.5 20H186.5"/><rect class="box done" x="22.5" y="11" width="56" height="18" rx="2"/><path class="tick" d="M44 20.5l4 4 8-8.5"/><rect class="box done" x="104.5" y="11" width="56" height="18" rx="2"/><path class="tick" d="M126 20.5l4 4 8-8.5"/><rect class="box done" x="186.5" y="11" width="56" height="18" rx="2"/><path class="tick" d="M208 20.5l4 4 8-8.5"/></svg></div>
      <div class="res"><div class="top1 hit"><span><b>All three steps, as marked</b></span></div></div>
      {/* The agent's name cycles (scripts/spaces/hero-name.js); "Codex" is the one without scripts or motion. */}
      <p class="q"><b class="hn" data-names="Codex|Claude Code|Pi|OpenCode"><span>Codex</span></b> built it. No surprises in review.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="pg">
