    <figure class="frm" role="img" aria-label="Left: on the GitHub pull request, the Plannotator Spaces bot lists two steps where the code leaves the plan. Right, a concept: the guided review in the space, each plan step beside the change step that carries it out. A pencil note asks: did we stick to the plan?"><div class="g5k" style="--g6h:700px"><div class="cap wide g6c"><img loading="lazy" class="il" src="/assets/spaces/img/prt2-l.png?v=2" width="466" height="600" alt=""><img loading="lazy" class="id" src="/assets/spaces/img/prt2-d.png?v=2" width="466" height="600" alt=""></div><div class="cap pn g5c" style="width:358px"><div class="crop" style="width:358px;height:458px"><img loading="lazy" class="il" src="/assets/spaces/img/pr-c-l.png?v=2" width="390" height="471" alt="" style="left:-16px;top:-12px"><img loading="lazy" class="id" src="/assets/spaces/img/pr-c-d.png?v=2" width="390" height="471" alt="" style="left:-16px;top:-12px"></div></div><div class="ask" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ar ar-u" width="34" height="62" viewBox="0 0 34 62"><path d="M19 59C14 43 15 24 21 5M9 17 21.5 4 30 19"/></svg><span class="note">Did we stick to the plan?</span><svg class="ar ar-r" width="72" height="40" viewBox="0 0 72 40"><path d="M3 27C22 31 45 27 66 11M52 8 67 10 60 25"/></svg><svg class="ar ar-d" width="40" height="56" viewBox="0 0 40 56"><path d="M14 3C20 17 21 33 18 51M7 39 18 52 30 41"/></svg></div><i class="tx tv g5t">GUIDED REVIEW</i><div class="cap wide g5g"><div class="spw sm n n2 n3"><div class="spw-bar"><b>Field notes</b><span>/</span><b>send-queued-edits-on-reconnect</b></div><div class="spw-body"><div class="spw-main"><div class="gv-h"><h4>Send queued edits on reconnect</h4><p>Guided review of pull request 212, against <b>Edit a note with no signal</b>, version 2.</p></div>
<div class="gv-cols"><span>The plan</span><span>The change</span><span></span></div>
<div class="gv-row ok"><div class="gv-p"><em>1.</em><span>Save edits to a queue on the phone.</span></div><div class="gv-c"><b>Queue edits while there is no signal</b><code>queue.ts</code></div><span class="gv-m">Follows the plan</span></div>
<div class="gv-row ok"><div class="gv-p"><em>2.</em><span>Send the queue in order when the signal returns.</span></div><div class="gv-c"><b>Send the queue in order</b><code>reconnect.ts</code></div><span class="gv-m">Follows the plan</span></div>
<div class="gv-row dep"><div class="gv-p"><em>3.</em><span>Keep both edits on a clash and show “Earlier edit”.</span></div><div class="gv-c"><b>On a clash, the older edit is dropped</b><code>resolveClash.ts</code></div><span class="gv-m">Departs</span><div class="gv-d"><span class="del">-  const [newest, older] = byTime(a, b);</span><span class="del">-  return &#123; shown: newest, earlier: [older] &#125;;</span><span class="add">+  const [newest] = byTime(a, b);</span><span class="add">+  return &#123; shown: newest, earlier: [] &#125;;</span></div></div>
<div class="gv-row no"><div class="gv-p"><em>4.</em><span>Show the last sent time on the note.</span></div><div class="gv-c"><b>Not in this change</b></div><span class="gv-m">Missing</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cap pn g5g" style="width:390px"><div class="spw sm"><div class="spw-bar"><b>Field notes</b><span>/</span><b>send-queued-edits-on-reconnect</b></div><div class="spw-body"><div class="spw-main"><div class="gv-h"><h4>Send queued edits on reconnect</h4><p>Guided review of pull request 212, against <b>Edit a note with no signal</b>, version 2.</p></div>
